  "html": "<p>NPC is the abbreviation for Non-Player Character.  They are characterized by speech and/or the quest interface.\nIf the creature needs to be killed without any sort of verbal interaction, it probably will be found in the <a href=\"/wiki/Category/Monsters\" title=\"Category:Monsters\">Monsters</a> category.\n</p><p>Here are all NPC's listen on alphabetic order.\n</p>\n\n<div id=\"mw-subcategories\">\n<h2>Subcategories</h2>\n<p>There are 3 subcategories to this category.\n</p><h3>B</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category/Bankers\" title=\"Category:Bankers\">Bankers</a></li></ul><h3>M</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category/Merchants\" title=\"Category:Merchants\">Merchants</a></li></ul><h3>S</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category/Skill_Trainers\" title=\"Category:Skill Trainers\">Skill Trainers</a></li></ul>\n</div><div id=\"mw-pages\">\n<h2>Articles in category \"NPC's\"</h2>\n<p>There are 66 articles in this category.\n</p><table width=\"100%\"><tr valign=\"top\"><td>\n<h3>A</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Abel_Tukahst\" title=\"Abel Tukahst\">Abel Tukahst</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Agent_Illiot_Fess\" title=\"Agent Illiot Fess\">Agent Illiot Fess</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Audrey_the_Alchemist\" title=\"Audrey the Alchemist\">Audrey the Alchemist</a></li></ul>\n<h3>B</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Baby_the_Line_Dancer\" title=\"Baby the Line Dancer\">Baby the Line Dancer</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Baem_-_Sir_Fess_of_Maerz\" title=\"Baem - Sir Fess of Maerz\">Baem - Sir Fess of Maerz</a></li></ul>\n<h3>C</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Chuck_McBarris\" title=\"Chuck McBarris\">Chuck McBarris</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Concerned_Abba_Labba\" title=\"Concerned Abba Labba\">Concerned Abba Labba</a></li></ul>\n<h3>D</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Deward_the_Arms_Merchant\" title=\"Deward the Arms Merchant\">Deward the Arms Merchant</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Dorcas\" title=\"Dorcas\">Dorcas</a></li></ul>\n<h3>F</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Fiery_Pygmy_Tracks